<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Jan 2 to 8:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.63</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 62.44</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 64.20</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 67.42</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$165.46</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$124.09</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 86.59</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.47</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.15</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.81</p>
</text>
